<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica de Espana cut. [CORRECTED 15:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica de Espana cut. [CORRECTED 15:30 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had cut its rating for Spain's Telefonica de Espana SA to market outperform from trading buy. (Corrects rating change).</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipt opened up one to 62-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
